{
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "看看吧......都是老东西。不过总有你需要的。",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]知识恶魔饶有兴趣地观察着周围。[/font_size][/i]",

    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "你还能把书当饭吃不成？看看别的收藏吧！",

    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "呵呵，这本书记录了上千年的历史，你绝对会感兴趣的！",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "回答",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "记录历史的典籍虽好。可真正有价值的，往往是那些被删除的部分。",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "你不要？那我可就放回去咯。",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "回应",
    "DARV.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.char": "[b]不！[/b]我是说，容我再想想......",

    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "[sine]你？...为何...会...来到...塔底...[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "为寻求无上的知识。",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.char": "为了全知...全能。",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-3.char": "以及——建筑师的大脑。",

    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...你想要的...答案...就在...塔顶...[/sine]",

    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "[sine]我...重塑了...你的肉身...快去...杀死建筑师[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "实际上，这具身体不过是容器。",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.char": "而我的精神是不朽的存在，你并没有重塑我，而是重塑了我的躯壳。",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "继续",
    "NEOW.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.ancient": "[sine]...快走...[/sine]",

    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "真是稀奇的访客啊！想要珠宝还是服饰？喜欢的就拿去吧。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "我不需要这种身外之物。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.ancient": "当你面对建筑师的时候——你会需要这些“身外之物”的。",

    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "是恶魔的味道...哼哼，连你也需要我的赐福吗？",

    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "通常我是不允许虫子出现在我的房间里的。你是第一个例外。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "回答",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "不要把我的容器和我混为一谈。我是知识这概念本身。",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "哦，呵呵呵，不好意思啦。",

    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "寄宿在大脑的恶魔？！可怕！不要控制我！",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "请你放心。你的大脑对我来说没有价值。",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.ancient": "什么？那就好！那就好！",

    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "恶魔！恶魔！寄生大脑的恶魔又出现了！",

    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "恶魔！不要再操纵别人的精神了！这样不好！！",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "回答",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "好啊。",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.char": "但是如果我照做了，这是不是意味着，你也操控了我的精神？",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "继续",
    "OROBAS.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.ancient": "哦！那你继续吧！等等？不对！等等？",

    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你已经学习了上千的知识，为何还在奢求更多？[/thinky_dots]",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "知识一旦停止增长——就开始腐烂。",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.char": "我无法满足……还需要更多，[b]更多！[/b][jitter][b]更多！[/b][/jitter]",

    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]贪婪的恶魔啊……为何还不学会满足呢？[/thinky_dots]",

    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]……你在看什么？[/thinky_dots]",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "回答",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "我在想，你的梦里是否有让我渴求的知识。",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]哼哼，有意思，那你就试试看吧……zZZzz……[/thinky_dots]",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "继续",
    "PAEL.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.char": "[i][font_size=22]知识恶魔盯着睡着的佩尔后许久，随后悻悻地离开了。[/font_size][/i]",

    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "[b]恶魔！你的武器在哪里？！[/b]",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "我不需要武器。我在岁月中沉淀的知识，会成为我最强大……",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.ancient": "[b]没有武器怎么能行！这个！给我拿着！[/b]",

    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "[b]你这也算一个恶魔吗！你的尖牙和利爪在哪里！！[/b]",

    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "[b]知识恶魔，与我一战！！[/b]",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]知识恶魔与坦克斯激战一番。[/font_size][/i]",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "[b]很好！很好！这个武器很趁手，给你了！[/b]",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.char": "我不需要……",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.next": "继续",
    "TANX.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-4.ancient": "[b]拿着！！[/b]",

    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "[jitter][b]啊呀[/b][/jitter]，好可爱的小虫子，你到这里做什么呀？？",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "我在这里，女士。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.ancient": "哦！居然会说话，我还是第一次见到这么[jitter][b]稀奇[/b][/jitter]的虫子呢。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.next": "继续",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-3.char": "女士？",

    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "欢迎欢迎，[jitter][b]小可爱[/b][/jitter]！来，吃点点心！",

    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "哦，可怜的小虫子。如果你想要我[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]烦人的寄生虫，随时可以来找我。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "回答",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "它听不见你的。",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "不……他会听见的。",

    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "我们同为恶魔，我被奉为神圣的存在，而你却困在一只虫豸的大脑里。",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.ancient": "肉体的束缚，多么无趣。与我交易，我会让你的灵魂彻底解放。",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "回答",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.char": "既然我们同为恶魔，这点伎俩就省省吧。恶魔的交易，从来不会是什么好东西。",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-3.char": "不过我接受了，为的是更远大的目标。",

    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]嘻嘻嘻！[/sine]你知道吗，和恶魔签订契约的恶魔，你还是第一个！",

    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.ancient": "让我看看你的能耐吧，知识恶魔。",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0.next": "展示",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]知识恶魔在瓦库脑内传了一声低语。[/font_size][/i]",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.ancient": "[sine]哈哈[/sine]……不错。不过这种小把戏，我也会。",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-2.next": "继续",
    "VAKUU.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-3.ancient": "给你看看这个，这才叫有意思的东西。",

    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.ancient": "你不在巢穴里守着城门，在这里做什么呢？",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-0.next": "回答",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.char": "我不甘愿被困于此。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-1.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.char": "唯有消灭你、解放高塔，自由才会真正属于我。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-2.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-3.ancient": "既然这样，那我来给你吧，真正的[b]自由[/b]。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.0-attack": "Both",


    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0.ancient": "你还不死心吗？离开职责的虫豸……通常活不久。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-0.next": "愤怒",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-1.char": "我可不是你口中的虫豸！[jitter]我是至高无上的恶魔！[/jitter]",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-1.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-2.ancient": "在我看来，你和你下面寄生的那只生物没什么两样。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-2.next": "继续",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-3.ancient": "你只会像那些虫豸一样，被我彻底消灭。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.1-attack": "Both",

    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0r.ancient": "你还要来挑战吗？老老实实回去，我还能饶你一命。",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-0r.next": "拒绝",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.KNOWLEDGE_DEMON_CHARACTER_KNOWLEDGE_DEMON.2-1r.char": "我不会接受这种结局。",
